abel></div></div><div class="s-row" data-tier="1"><div class="s-l"><div class="s-lab">Weather</div><div class="s-sub">Search a city for the current conditions</div></div><div class="s-c"><label class="sw"><input type="checkbox" data-s="weather"><span></span></label></div></div><div class="s-row" data-tier="2"><div class="s-l"><div class="s-lab">World clock</div><div class="s-sub">Time in up to 4 places around the world</div></div><div class="s-c"><label class="sw"><input type="checkbox" data-s="world"><span></span></label></div></div><div class="s-row" data-tier="2"><div class="s-l"><div class="s-lab">World clock places</div><div class="s-sub">Comma-separated IANA zones, e.g. Europe/Paris, Asia/Dubai · Founders: up to 8 · up to 8 on Founders</div></div><div class="s-c"><input type="text" class="s-input wide" data-s="zones" placeholder="America/New_York, Europe/London"></div></div><div class="s-row" data-tier="1"><div class="s-l"><div class="s-lab">Stopwatch</div><div class="s-sub">With lap times</div></div><div class="s-c"><label class="sw"><input type="checkbox" data-s="stopwatch"><span></span></label></div></div><div class="s-row"><div class="s-l"><div class="s-lab">Widget layout</div><div class="s-sub">Drag any widget to move it anywhere. Double-click a widget’s title to send it back.</div></div><div class="s-c"><button type="button" class="s-btn" onclick="resetWidgetLayout()">Reset layout</button></div></div><div class="s-row"><div class="s-l"><div class="s-lab">Text sizes</div><div class="s-sub">Right-click any widget, or the clock, to change its title and text size separately.</div></div><div class="s-c"><button type="button" class="s-btn" onclick="resetTextSizes()">Reset text sizes</button></div></div><div class="s-row"><div class="s-l"><div class="s-lab">Calendar week starts on</div></div><div class="s-c"><select class="s-select" data-s="weekStart"><option value="1">Monday</option><option value="0">Sunday</option></select></div></div></div></section><section class="s-pane" id="pane-workspaces"><div class="s-head"><div class="s-tile big"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="6" height="16" rx="1.5"/><rect x="12" y="4" width="9" height="16" rx="2"/></svg></div><h2>Workspaces</h2></div><div class="s-cap">Add a workspace</div><div class="s-card"><div class="s-row"><div class="s-l"><div class="s-lab">Name</div><div class="s-sub">Each workspace has its own apps, widgets, notes, to-dos and wallpaper</div></div><div class="s-c"><input type="text" class="s-input wide" id="wsNewName" placeholder="e.g. Study, Gaming" maxlength="24" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter') createWorkspaceFromSettings()"><button type="button" class="s-btn primary" onclick="createWorkspaceFromSettings()">Add</button></div></div></div><div class="s-cap">Your workspaces <span class="hint">· switch, rename, PIN-protect or delete</span></div><div class="s-card" id="wsSettingsList"></div></section><section class="s-pane" id="pane-system"><div class="s-head"><div class="s-tile big"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3M4.9 4.9l2.1 2.1M17 17l2.1 2.1M19.1 4.9L17 7M7 17l-2.1 2.1"/></svg></div><h2>System</h2></div><div class="s-cap">Backup</div><div class="s-card"><div class="s-row" data-tier="1"><div class="s-l"><div class="s-lab">Export settings</div><div class="s-sub">Saves a .zip with your apps, themes, fonts, wallpapers, and settings</div></div><div class="s-c"><button type="button" class="s-btn" onclick="exportSettings('dock')">Dock only</button><button type="button" class="s-btn" onclick="exportSettings('one')">This workspace</button><button type="button" class="s-btn primary" onclick="exportSettings('all')">All workspaces</button></div></div><div class="s-row" data-tier="1"><div class="s-l"><div class="s-lab">Import settings</div></div><div class="s-c"><button type="button" class="s-btn" onclick="document.getElementById('importFile').click()">Choose file…</button><input type="file" id="importFile" accept=".zip,application/zip,application/json,.json" hidden onchange="importSettings(this.files[0])"></div></div></div><div class="s-cap">About</div><div class="s-card"><div class="s-row"><div class="s-l"><div class="s-lab">Edition</div></div><div class="s-c"><span class="edition-pill big" id="editionPill2"></span></div></div><div class="s-row" id="founderNoRow" style="display:none"><div class="s-l"><div class="s-lab">Founder number</div><div class="s-sub">Shown on your Founders badge</div></div><div class="s-c"><input type="text" class="s-input mono" data-s="founderNo" placeholder="0001" maxlength="5"></div></div><div class="s-row"><div class="s-l"><div class="s-lab">SparkOS</div><div class="s-sub">Made by Viwin Jayaramanrani</div></div><div class="s-c"><span class="s-val static" id="aboutVer">Version 10.0</span></div></div><div class="s-row"><div class="s-l"><div class="s-lab">Apps in dock</div></div><div class="s-c"><span class="s-val static" id="aboutApps">0</span></div></div></div><div class="s-cap">Lock &amp; privacy</div><div class="s-card"><div class="s-row"><div class="s-l"><div class="s-lab">Require unlock</div><div class="s-sub">Show a PIN lock when SparkOS opens (and when you lock it)</div></div><div class="s-c"><label class="sw"><input type="checkbox" id="lockEnabled" onchange="toggleLockEnabled(this.checked)"><span></span></label></div></div><div class="s-row"><div class="s-l"><div class="s-lab">Set / change PIN</div><div class="s-sub">4 digits · stored only on this device as a hash</div></div><div class="s-c"><button type="button" class="s-btn primary" onclick="promptSetPin()">Set PIN…</button></div></div><div class="s-row"><div class="s-l"><div class="s-lab">Touch ID / Face ID (Default)</div><div class="s-sub">Prompts Touch ID / Face ID automatically first when unlocking SparkOS or protected workspaces</div></div><div class="s-c"><button type="button" class="s-btn" id="bioSetupBtn" onclick="setupBiometric()">Set up…</button><button type="button" class="s-btn danger" id="bioClearBtn" style="display:none" onclick="clearBiometric()">Remove</button></div></div><div class="s-row"><div class="s-l"><div class="s-lab">Lock now</div></div><div class="s-c"><button type="button" class="s-btn" onclick="lockSparkOS()">Lock SparkOS</button></div></div><div class="s-row"><div class="s-l"><div class="s-lab">Quick Hide (⌘⇧H)</div><div class="s-sub">Instantly switch to an unlocked workspace or hide widgets; press again to restore</div></div><div class="s-c"><button type="button" class="s-btn" onclick="toggleQuickHide()">Quick Hide</button></div></div></div><div class="s-cap">Danger zone</div><div class="s-card"><div class="s-row"><div class="s-l"><div class="s-lab">Reset everything</div><div class="s-sub">Erases all apps and settings</div></div><div class="s-c"><button type="button" class="s-btn danger" onclick="resetSystemData()">Reset SparkOS…</button></div></div></div></section></main>
